<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 589.95, up 2.59.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 300 to 228.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.06.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 24,943,540 compared with 24,304,920 on Thursday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
